config BR2_PACKAGE_DASH_OTA
	bool "dash-ota"
	select BR2_PACKAGE_OPENSSL
	select BR2_PACKAGE_LIBCURL
	select BR2_PACKAGE_LIBCURL_CURL
	select BR2_PACKAGE_CA_CERTIFICATES
	help
	  Over-the-air updates (the T113 Dash's package): sig-verify (Ed25519 over the release's SHA256SUMS, with
	  libcrypto); dash-update and S99ota come from the board overlay. Pulls in curl and the CA bundle: busybox
	  wget has no HTTPS with certificate checks.
